# Guide of Souls, both halves in one game: three other creatures entering bank three energy counters a life at a
# time (its own entry is not "another creature"), and the attack trigger spends all three at once on one of the two
# attackers -- two +1/+1 counters, a flying counter, and a creature type it keeps.
# The Mothers are cast a turn apart so each entry is its own trigger, and the third is cast on the same turn it
# attacks with the other two, which is what makes the total exactly three when the payment is offered.
